# duct-tape is the kernel-emulation glue that compiles the vendored XNU
# (osfmk/bsd) into libdarlingserver_duct_tape.a, which the Rust daemon links
# via DUCT_TAPE_LIB. Host tier: native ELF, no cross toolchain, no Mach-O.

